During initrd the deploy process may stall on low memory situations as the raspberrypi
DMA driver allocates memory pool with GFP_KERNEL which may wait until more memory is available.
DMA drivers shall use GFP_NOWAIT for DMA allocation at runtime.

Long term test showed 2450 successful runs after this patch, while it stalled after maximum 30 runs
without this patch.

--- a/drivers/dma/bcm2835-dma.c	2019-04-18 12:04:58.670499740 +0200
+++ b/drivers/dma/bcm2835-dma.c	2019-04-18 12:06:29.984196198 +0200
@@ -690,7 +692,7 @@
 	d = bcm2835_dma_create_cb_chain(chan, direction, false,
 					info, extra,
 					frames, src, dst, 0, 0,
-					GFP_KERNEL);
+					GFP_NOWAIT);
 	if (!d)
 		return NULL;
 
